  "description": "New to the Market – c.30.17 Acres of Agricultural Land with Extensive Farm Buildings\nCastlerea Area, Co. Roscommon\n\n(Plus Farm Entitlements)\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this quality holding of c.30.17 acres of agricultural land, laid out in one folio, all located within a strong farming hinterland just 10 minutes from Castlerea Town.\n\nThe lands are of good agricultural quality throughout and are suitable for a range of farming enterprises, with the added benefit of extensive farm buildings offering immediate operational use.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for existing farmers looking to expand, or investors seeking a well-located landholding with entitlements.\n\nThe Property Comprises:\nFolio RN46089F – c.30.17 acres\nGood quality agricultural lands laid out in 5 divisions\nTotal: c.30.17 acres (12.21 hectares)\n\nFarm Buildings Include:\n3 bay slatted shed\n2 stand-alone machinery storage sheds with lockable steel doors\nLoose cattle housing shed\nTwo additional secure storage sheds with lockable steel doors\n\nKey Features:\nc.30.17 acres of good quality agricultural land\nLaid out in 5 divisions\n\nExtensive range of farm buildings\nSecure storage throughout with lockable sheds\nStrong farming area with adjoining agricultural holdings\nLocated just 10 minutes from Castlerea Town\nFarm entitlements (subject to terms)\n\nThe lands are situated within a well-regarded farming district, with all local amenities easily accessible in Castlerea and surrounding areas.\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial holding in a proven agricultural location with excellent infrastructure already in place.\n\nViewing and further details available on request.\nSole Agent: Nigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n086 2130723 | 094 9362216\n\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD\n\nDisclaimer:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance only and do not form part of any contract. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all details.",
